@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5111

### 1. Fetch all audited invoices (GET -> 200 OK)
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/invoices/
Accept: application/json

### 2. Submit a valid new invoice (POST -> 201 Created)
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/invoices/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceNumber": "INV-1004",
  "carrierName": "North American Van Lines",
  "weightLbs": 9200.00,
  "amount": 3450.00,
  "isDuplicate": false
}

### 3. Test Invalid Input (POST -> 400 Bad Request)
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/invoices/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceNumber": "INV-9999",
  "carrierName": "Bad Carrier",
  "createdAt": "2026-11-14T21:30:00Z",
  "weightLbs": 1000.00,
  "amount": -50.00,
  "isDuplicate": false
}

### Submit invoice with NO date (Server auto-fills it!)
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/invoices/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceNumber": "INV-1005",
  "carrierName": "FedEx Freight",
  "weightLbs": 4500.00,
  "amount": 1650.00,
  "isDuplicate": false
}